SUMMARY:Stroll Through Sonoma's History at Sonoma Barracks
DESCRIPTION:Stroll Through Sonoma's History at Sonoma Barracks is a guided half-mile walking tour led by George Webber\, Stephen Steiner\, and Peter Meyerhof of the sites\, original documents and photos associated with Solomon Schocken who was one of Sonoma's most historically significant citizens.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/stroll-through-sonomas-history-at-sonoma-barracks/
