SUMMARY:The Blenders at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Be among the first to experience The Blenders\, a new vocal jazz ensemble\, performing alongside the Jazz Collaboration Band. This lively evening features rich harmonies and timeless favorites\, from Duke Ellington classics to soulful Roy Orbison hits. Special guest Henry Castro of Rose Stone adds to the dynamic lineup.    Perfect for music lovers and dancers alike\, the event invites guests to enjoy an energetic night of swing and community. Doors open at 5:30 PM\, with the show running from 6:00–8:30 PM.    Tickets are available in advance or at the door\, with all ages welcome.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/the-blenders-swing-music-and-dancing/
LOCATION:528 7th Street, Santa Rosa, CA, 95401
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
